 ["Science grows through observation, questions, experiments and new ideas. Old ideas are tested and sometimes replaced when better evidence appears.","Indian scientists such as C. V. Raman, Jagadish Chandra Bose and Aryabhata made important discoveries.","Scientific thinking means asking questions, collecting evidence and not accepting a claim without proof."],
